/Title (Every major sector is currently drowning in inefficiency, data blind spots, and operational friction. The promise of the "Information Age" has curdled into a reality of fragmentation. Businesses utilize an average of 10+ disconnected SaaS tools to manage their operations, creating silos where data goes to die. The Fragmentation Trap: Email, CRM, Project Management, and Financial tools do not speak to each other. This forces humans to act as "manual routers," copying and pasting data between systems, leading to burnout and error.)
